   "prompt": "<p>Compute</p>$$ \\det \\left( \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 8 & 6 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}^{-1} \\right) $$<p>without computing the inverse.</p>",
   "answer": {
