   "prompt": "<p>Suppose $\\kA$ and $S$ are $n \\times n$ matrices, and $S$ is invertible. Suppose that $\\det(\\kA) = 3$. Compute $\\det(S^{-1}\\kA S)$ and $\\det(S\\kA S^{-1})$. Justify your answer using the theorems in this section.</p>",
